<title>USA: PSE says names Langley president, coo.</title>
<headline>PSE says names Langley president, coo.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-09-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Pacific Stock Exchange (PSE) said on Tuesday it appointed R. Warren Langley its president and chief operating officer.  </p>
<p>The exchange said Langley would join the exchange in mid-September. He fills posts vacated by Robert Greber, who became the exchange's chairman and chief executive officer in January.</p>
<p>Langley will oversee the exchange's day-to-day operations including trading floors and corporate and administrative services. He joins the PSE from Hull Trading Co.</p>
<p>--Chicago derivatives desk, (312) 408-8750</p>
